# macOS folder metadata
.DS_Store

# Compiled binary produced by `make build`
/parlay

# Advisory lock guarding domain-model.yaml writes (core/internal/domainmodel)
**/.parlay/domain-model.lock

# Advisory locks taken by the ledger store (core/internal/ledger) and by the
# authority capsule. Runtime state for one process, never work product.
**/.parlay/locks/
**/.parlay/build/**/.authority.lock

# The emitted manifest of a run in progress. Its consumed counterpart
# (.emitted.consumed) IS tracked — that one is the record of what a completed
# run wrote; this one is the scratch list of what the current run is writing.
**/.parlay/build/_project/.emitted

# A refinement's step journal, so an interrupted run can resume. Cleared when
# the refinement finishes, so a committed one would be a resume cursor pointing
# at work somebody else already completed.
**/.parlay/build/**/.refine-journal.yaml
